    For</b></span></td>
    <td style="text-align: center; padding-bottom: 1pt; width: 2%">&#160;</td>
    <td style="border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 23%; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>Votes
